cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Topological ML Toolkit: shape-of-data features for Rust and Python ML pipelines"
abstract: >-
  A Rust and Python library that turns the shape of data into features,
  diagnostics, and benchmarked ML pipeline components. It measures
  connected components, loops, voids, covers, neighborhoods, trajectories,
  and consistency constraints, and exposes them as ordinary ML features,
  model-debugging signals, or routing rules.
